! Proposal deliberation (archived)

Historical comparison of suggested changes. Scores are judgments, not measured system performance. Current instructions live in [[Art Sigils Practice|ha.ka.ba/lares/docs/art-sigils/practice]]; this archive is not an execution plan.

<<~ ahu slot=`#/rubric`>>
!! Rubric (judgment, not measured model fidelity)

G gap severity (25%) · T transferability across worktypes (25%) · E observed evidence and source support (20%) · S semantic safety (15%) · M manageability (15%). Score = 5G + 5T + 4E + 3S + 3M, each factor 0–5. Scores rank proposal desirability, not operational dependencies.

| Rank | Change | Score | Decision |
|---|---|---:|---|
| 1 | Diversify examples beyond concept boards | 97 | Draft |
| 2 | Reference-input roles | 93 | Draft companion meme |
| 3 | Distinguish alpha, artistic transparency and layer opacity | 92 | Draft spec amendment |
| 4 | Artistic / artifact / execution contracts | 91 | Draft companion meme |
| 5 | Human-in-the-loop reception QA | 90 | Draft companion meme |
| 6 | Provenance and publication handoff | 88 | Draft companion meme |
| 7 | Layer-composition contract | 86 | Draft companion meme |
| 8 | Exact typography and verification | 83 | Draft spec note + example |
| 9 | Extract specialist research | 74 | Deferred; no cut |
| 10 | Consolidate repeated warnings | 63 | Deferred; preserve standalone meaning |
| 11 | Add `art-layer()` to universal grammar | 57 | Rejected for now |

These are authorial priority judgments. No performance study establishes the rank order.
